Memory 胸にからませ 星空に
With memories tangling in my chest, looking up at the starry sky,

694
01:00:32,328 --> 01:00:34,478
手を 差し出そう 新しい 扉の前で
I'll reach out my hand before a new door.

695
01:00:34,478 --> 01:00:36,328
秘密の鍵 奇跡よ いつまでも
A secret key, oh miracle, forever.

696
01:00:36,328 --> 01:00:38,328
自分にとって 気分は刺激的で怖くて
To me, the mood feels so thrilling and terrifying,

697
01:00:38,328 --> 01:00:42,728
プチすんさって BAD GIRL状態
in a slightly rebellious bad girl state.

698
01:00:50,528 --> 01:00:52,428
君の愛に包まれて痛い
Wrapped in your love, it hurts so bad.

699
01:00:52,428 --> 01:00:54,428
君がいればそれだけでいい
If you're here, that's all I need.

700
01:00:54,428 --> 01:00:57,028
自然に芽生えていくものを大事にしていく
Cherishing what naturally begins to sprout,

701
01:00:57,028 --> 01:00:58,728
溢れ出すいっぱいの笑顔
overflowing with countless smiles,

702
01:00:58,728 --> 01:00:59,628
夢でも
even in a dream.

703
01:01:10,028 --> 01:01:13,728
GIGI ROOM PARTY!

